# Card LOD thumbs USED to be ignored here as build artifacts, regenerated with
# `python scripts/generate_lods.py`. They are committed now (v0.43.0).
#
# They are not artifacts of the build; they are INPUTS to it. `src/data/catalog.ts` require()s all 369
# of them by name, so a clone without them cannot bundle at all -- which is exactly what Cloudflare
# Pages is, and its build died on the first one:
#
#   Unable to resolve module ../../assets/extracted_cards/Domains/Arcana/arcana-01-1_lod.webp
#
# The alternative was making every build host run Python and Pillow to regenerate 3.3 MB of thumbs
# that change about once a year, next to the 32.5 MB of full-res card art already committed beside
# them. Regenerate with the script when the source art changes, and commit the result.

# Local-only rulebook reference scratch (licensed; transcribe to data, NEVER push)
assets/temp/
scripts/_class_pages.txt
scripts/_class_data.json
scripts/_features_full.txt

# stray editor/calibration backups
*.bak

# build logs (transient)
apk-build/*.log
dm210-build.log

# Zipped web export, produced for uploading to Cloudflare Pages (see docs/web-deploy.md).
RuneKeep-web-*.zip

# Claude's project memory lives at .claude/memory/ and IS committed (see docs/fresh-machine.md).
# Everything else Claude Code writes into .claude/ is per-machine.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/memory/
